      "trigger": "Each eligible on_shoot event with any target weakspot true adds one effective stack after the shot's hit/critical processing; false resets accrued stacks, and one multi-target hit-scan result adds at most one. There is no time decay.",
      "stat_application": "Adds generic critical_strike_chance. The parent tier override replaces the child's conditional base 5% key with the selected 2/3/4/5% value before effective stacks are applied; it is not an extra 5%. The conditional bonus applies only while the attached pistol is wielded. Switching away pauses the bonus and preserves stacks; off-slot shots do not add or reset them.",
      "supported_modes": "Accatran MG Mk II ordinary/aimed hitscan and Branx MkVI/MKII ordinary/aimed/chemical hitscan feed the weakspot result event. Chemical dart direct hits use the shot critical flag; generated chemical explosions are fixed noncritical and do not create another on_shoot event. Poison ticks do not independently produce this trait event. Laspistol ordinary/Psyker pushes are outside the shot event and fixed noncritical.",
      "arithmetic": "Craw = C0 + n*d, then critical chance is clamped. At IV and five stacks, 20% becomes 45% (+25 percentage points, +125% relative); 80% plus the same bonus clamps from 105% to 100%.",
